5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to verify if we have the crew capacity to actually run these plans.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We keep proposing new things without checking if the old ones failed. I want the pilots.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I am concerned about the administrative hurdles. Who else has to say yes to these changes?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about where the money comes from. I want to see the capital ledger balances.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to know where passengers actually lose time, not just where they complain about crowds.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, if the ledger is tight, we cannot afford to hire new staff for these roles.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, the committee minutes might show why previous proposals were rejected. That is useful context.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, yes. I will look at the joint operators' committee minutes to see the approval chain.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, I agree. I will also check the ticketing contractor fees to see if we can save there.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I will look at the journey audits and the timed runs to find the real bottlenecks.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the roster books for the late-turn pool to see who is actually available.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the accessibility programme.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will also look into the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells to understand the ground risks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I am still thinking about the long-term costs. I will stick to the ledger and the contractor fees.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I am excited to see if the stopwatch data matches the complaints. Let's see what the audits say.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,It is better to know the limits now than to promise what we cannot deliver later.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to let us repeat the same mistakes. The history is right there if we look.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I prefer to know the hidden costs before we commit. It is safer that way.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I just want to avoid another argument about which department pays for this.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I hope the data shows us the truth. I am ready to look into the numbers.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
